{"strongs": "H4709", "word": "מִצְפָּה", "translit": "mits.pah", "root": "צעף", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "near Hermon", "definition": "מִצְפָּה 38 proper name, of a location (properly outlook-point or -height ; with article (exceptHos Josh 5:1 )); — 1. in Gilead, explanation as name given to Laban's cairn, north of Jabbok Gen 31:49 (on text see Ball Holz ; ᵐ5 ἡ ὅρασις ). 2. probably south of Jabbok, Judg 10:17 ( ἡ σκοπιά ), Judg 11:11 ; Judg 11:34 ( Μασσηφα ; so ᵐ5 L Judg 10:17 ), Hos 5:1 ( ἡ σκοπιά ); apparently = II. מִצְפֶּה 3 , Buhl Geogr. 262 ( פֶּה -, פָּה -, seem to interchange); site unknown; see conjectures in Buhl l.c. , compare GASm Geogr. 586. 3 . near Hermon , ׳ אֶרֶץ הַמּ Josh 11:3 , Μασευμαν , Μασσηφα ( θ ), = בִּקְעַתמִֿצְפֶּה v Josh 11:8 , Μασσωχ , Μασσηφα ; see Buhl Geogr. 240. 4. old sacred place in Benjamin, Μασσηφα , etc.; — ׳ הַמּ Judg 20:1 +, הַמִּצְפָּ֫תָה 1Sam 7:5 +; — Judg 20:1 ; Judg 20:3 ; Judg 21:1 ; Judg 21:5 ; Judg 21:8 ; 1Sam 7:5 + 7 t. 1Sam 7 ; 1Sam 10 ; 1Kgs 15:22 = 2Chr 16:6 ; 2Kgs 25:23 ; 2Kgs 25:25 ; Jer 40:10 + 12 t. 40, 41; Neh 3:7 ; Neh 3:15 ; Neh 3:19 = הַמִּצְפֶּה Josh 18:26 — modern Nabî Samwîl , 5 miles northwest of Jerusalem, see Buhl Geogr. 167 f. .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7182')\">BDB7182</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H4709')\">H4709</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7181')\">BDB7181</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7183')\">BDB7183</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>מִצְפָּה</bdbheb><sub>38</sub> <b>proper name, of a location</b> (properly <highlight>outlook-point</highlight> or <highlight>-height</highlight>; with article (exceptHos <ref ref=\"Josh 5:1\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(6,5,1)\">Josh 5:1</ref>)); — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> in Gilead, explanation as name given to Laban's cairn, north of Jabbok <ref ref=\"Gen 31:49\" b=\"1\" cBegin=\"31\" vBegin=\"49\" cEnd=\"31\" vEnd=\"49\" onclick=\"bcv(1,31,49)\">Gen 31:49</ref> (on text see Ball <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Holz')\">Holz</lookup>; <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb></lookup> <grk>ἡ ὅρασις</grk>). </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> probably south of Jabbok, <ref ref=\"Judg 10:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,17)\">Judg 10:17</ref> (<grk>ἡ σκοπιά</grk>), <ref ref=\"Judg 11:11\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,11)\">Judg 11:11</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 11:34\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"34\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"34\" onclick=\"bcv(7,11,34)\">Judg 11:34</ref> (<grk>Μασσηφα</grk>; so <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Sept')\"><bdbheb><reflink>ᵐ5</reflink></bdbheb><reflink><sup>L</sup></reflink></lookup> <ref ref=\"Judg 10:17\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(7,10,17)\">Judg 10:17</ref>), <ref ref=\"Hos 5:1\" b=\"28\" cBegin=\"5\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"5\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(28,5,1)\">Hos 5:1</ref> (<grk>ἡ σκοπιά</grk>); apparently = II. <bdbheb>מִצְפֶּה</bdbheb> <b>3</b>, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 262</sup></lookup> (<bdbheb>פֶּה</bdbheb>-, <bdbheb>פָּה</bdbheb>-, seem to interchange); site unknown; see conjectures in <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>l.c.</sup></lookup>, compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('GASm')\">GASm<sup>Geogr. 586.</sup></lookup> <b>3</b>. <highlightword>near Hermon</highlightword>, <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>אֶרֶץ הַמּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Josh 11:3\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,3)\">Josh 11:3</ref>, <grk>Μασευμαν</grk>, <grk>Μασσηφα</grk>(<grk>θ</grk>), = <bdbheb>בִּקְעַתמִֿצְפֶּה</bdbheb> v<ref ref=\"Josh 11:8\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"11\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"11\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(6,11,8)\">Josh 11:8</ref>, <grk>Μασσωχ</grk>, <grk>Μασσηφα</grk>; see <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Buhl')\">Buhl<sup>Geogr. 240.</sup></lookup> </div><div class=\"point\"><b>4.</b> old sacred place in Benjamin, <grk>Μασσηφα</grk>, etc.; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>הַמּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 20:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,1)\">Judg 20:1</ref> +, <bdbheb>הַמִּצְפָּ֫תָה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,5)\">1Sam 7:5</ref> +; — <ref ref=\"Judg 20:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,1)\">Judg 20:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 20:3\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"20\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"20\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(7,20,3)\">Judg 20:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:1\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,1)\">Judg 21:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:5\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,5)\">Judg 21:5</ref>; <ref ref=\"Judg 21:8\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"21\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"21\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(7,21,8)\">Judg 21:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 7:5\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"5\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"5\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,5)\">1Sam 7:5</ref> + 7 t. <ref ref=\"1Sam 7\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(9,7,1)\">1Sam 7</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 10\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"200\" onclick=\"bcv(9,10,1)\">1Sam 10</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 15:22\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(11,15,22)\">1Kgs 15:22</ref> = <ref ref=\"2Chr 16:6\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"6\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"6\" onclick=\"bcv(14,16,6)\">2Chr 16:6</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:23\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"23\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"23\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,23)\">2Kgs 25:23</ref>; <ref ref=\"2Kgs 25:25\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"25\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"25\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(12,25,25)\">2Kgs 25:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Jer 40:10\" b=\"24\" cBegin=\"40\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"40\" vEn